<h1>FandomVerse: Portal for Fandom World</h1>
<p><strong>Aptech Limited &bull; Techwiz 7 Championship</strong><br>
<strong>Project Theme:</strong> Fandom Universe<br>
<strong>Category:</strong> Web Innovation Unleashed<br>
<strong>Document Version:</strong> 1.0 (Submission Release)</p>

<hr>

<h2>1. Problem Definition</h2>
<p>Modern fandom enthusiasts passionate about Anime, Gaming, Movies, TV Shows, K-Pop, Comics, and Manga face severe information fragmentation. Crucial news, trailer announcements, character profiles, convention dates, and fan merchandise are scattered across dozens of individual portals. FandomVerse solves this by delivering a centralized, visually stunning Single Page Application (SPA) unifying all 7 categories with real-time client-side interactivity.</p>

<h2>2. Design Specifications & Tech Stack</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Architecture:</strong> 100% Frontend-Only SPA built with React 18, Vite, and Tailwind CSS.</li>
  <li><strong>Zero Backend Compliance:</strong> Strictly satisfies SRS Constraint 1.5. No server-side databases or write endpoints are used.</li>
  <li><strong>Data Storage:</strong> 14 pre-populated JSON files stored in <code>/public/data/</code> representing all 7 fandom universes, character rosters, trailers, merchandise, and chatbot knowledge.</li>
  <li><strong>Browser Storage Architecture:</strong>
    <ul>
      <li><code>localStorage</code>: Persistent simulated visitor counter and saved bookmarks.</li>
      <li><code>sessionStorage</code>: Personal notes attached to bookmarks (cleared when browser session ends).</li>
    </ul>
  </li>
</ul>

