<h2>4. Mandatory Project Installation Instructions</h2>
<pre>
1. Extract or navigate into project directory:
   cd fandom_verse

2. Install dependencies:
   npm install

3. Run in development mode:
   npm run dev
   (Open http://localhost:5173 in any modern web browser)

4. Or build and run production preview:
   npm run build
   npm run preview
   (Open http://localhost:4173 in browser)
</pre>

<h2>5. Assumptions Made</h2>
<ol>
  <li><strong>No Server Database:</strong> In strict compliance with SRS Section 1.5, the application runs entirely in the browser using client-side JavaScript. No backend server or write endpoints exist.</li>
  <li><strong>Simulated Billing:</strong> In accordance with SRS Section 1.4, checkout and payment functions are simulated with dynamic client-side calculations (subtotal, 8% sales tax, grand total) without connecting to payment gateways.</li>
  <li><strong>Session-Only Notes:</strong> Notes created for bookmarked items are stored in <code>sessionStorage</code> and intentionally expire when the browser tab/session is closed.</li>
  <li><strong>Royalty-Free & Embed Media:</strong> Video trailers are embedded via YouTube's iframe API and audio previews utilize royalty-free sound clips to adhere to copyright constraints.</li>
</ol>

<hr>
<p><em>Submitted for Aptech Techwiz 7 &bull; Web Innovation Unleashed</em></p>

